Description: Speech Dispatcher module: languages and voices of the user
 Also load the languages and voices in $XDG_DATA_HOME/RHVoice/languages and
 voices (~/.local/share/RHVoice/...), one directory each, as the RHVoice
 package format has them. A settings program can then install voices from
 the RHVoice package directory without root. A newer version there wins
 over the system one, as with any resource path.
Author: Grigory Tuboltsev <gtubolcev@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
